meta {
  name: Get Session Analytics
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/analytics
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{participantToken}}
}

tests {
  test("returns role-scoped Game Session analytics and cohortSummary", function() {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.cohortSummary.sessionId).to.be.a("string");
  });
}

docs {
  # GET /api/v1/sessions/:sessionId/analytics (`getSessionAnalytics`)

  Computes live metacognitive and gameplay analytics for a **Game Session**:
  - **Learner (`{{participantToken}}`)**: Receives `{ role: "participant", participantReport, cohortSummary }`, where `participantReport` contains `pretest`, `posttest`, `knowledgeGainDelta`, `guessingReductionDelta`, `chainDiversityIndex`, and `neglectedKeywordIds`.
  - **Instructor (`{{instructorToken}}`)**: Receives `{ role: "instructor", cohortSummary }`, where `cohortSummary` contains `sessionId`, `participantCount`, `meanPretestScore`, `meanPosttestScore`, `meanKnowledgeGainDelta`, `meanGuessingReductionDelta`, `meanChainDiversityIndex`, and `boardNeglectHeatmap`.

  ## Responses & Error Codes (`ApiErrorCode`)
  - **`200 OK`**: Role-scoped analytics payload.
  - **`401 UNAUTHORIZED_TOKEN`**: Missing or invalid Capability Token.
  - **`403 FORBIDDEN_ROLE`**: Token belongs to another Game Session.
  - **`404 SESSION_NOT_FOUND`**: Unknown `sessionId`.
}
